   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Edge: Cloudflare Tunnel / HTTPS / optional Zero Trust, then the FastAPI\nentrypoint\nTLS and reverse proxy live outside the app; the new in-app limiter caps\n/integrations/* and returns 429 with Retry-After. Never put SALES_INTAKE_SECRET\nin browser JS - use a serverless relay. Provider key missing? Dashboard, /health\nand /docs stay up; only the feature reports disabled.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "r1017",
   "originalText": "Edge: Cloudflare Tunnel / HTTPS / optional Zero Trust, then the FastAPI\nentrypoint\nTLS and reverse proxy live outside the app; the new in-app limiter caps\n/integrations/* and returns 429 with Retry-After. Never put SALES_INTAKE_SECRET\nin browser JS - use a serverless relay. Provider key missing? Dashboard, /health\nand /docs stay up; only the feature reports disabled.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
