   "originalText": "Mutating operator-action gate: X-Founder-\nAction-Token = SALES_ACTION_TOKEN\nRequired for resolving, draft change,\napprove, send, suppress, research and setup\nwrites. V2 closes the holes: setup step\nwrite, coding create and apply, monitor run,\nmarketing approve, regenerate, variant\nselect, G3 create and Buffer schedule.",
