   "text": "Control gates 1-7 hold\nProvider calls optional and scoped; model\noutput is a draft with approval and\nsending separate; suppressed leads cannot\nbe enriched or contacted; auto contact\noff by default; G1 knowledge gates G2; G3\ndraft-only; setup reads never return\nsecrets.",
