   "text": "Sales service\nIntake upsert with attribution passthrough,\ncached company and contact resolution,\nenrichment, qualification, model-backed editable\ndraft, human edit then approve then send, Resend\ndelivery and reply ingest, meeting, suppression.\nNEW follow-up state: next_follow_up_at and\nfollow_up_count, cleared by reply, bounce,\nmeeting or suppression.",
