   "text": "Marketing orchestration\nCampaign and manual-post APIs, per-org\ncapabilities and accounts, G1 content package and\nclaim validation, G2 asset search, voice and\nFFmpeg render, variant choice, G3 R2 upload plus\nBuffer draft only. Tracks campaign_id, post_id\nand UTM. Pending review: approve or regenerate -\nretry is rejected.",
