   "text": "NEW scheduler service - jobs table, advisory-only batches\nDeep research, scoring, enrichment batches for qualified accounts only, draft\ngeneration, follow-up generation, daily priority-card build, provider health via\ncheck_all, cost digest. Jobs may write drafts, tasks and suggestions - they never send,\npublish, execute LinkedIn actions or change suppression state.",
