   "text": "Media worker node (WORKER_MODE=remote,\n4 vCPU / 8 GB)\nFFmpeg rendering and asset packs.\nSpawns over a configured transport\ninstead of local subprocess.Popen, and\nwrites through the app API because\nSQLite stays single-writer.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "r1107",
   "originalText": "Media worker node (WORKER_MODE=remote,\n4 vCPU / 8 GB)\nFFmpeg rendering and asset packs.\nSpawns over a configured transport\ninstead of local subprocess.Popen, and\nwrites through the app API because\nSQLite stays single-writer.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
