   "text": "STOP - backup and restore\nBack up with scripts/backup.sh\nusing sqlite3 .backup, never cp\na live database. Restore only\nwith scripts/restore.sh\n--verify. A suppressed lead\ncannot move on any path,\nincluding scheduler jobs.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
