   "text": "Data governance boundary: lead and email records may be personal data. Operators - not the software - own lawful collection, consent, retention, deletion, suppression and provider compliance. Never place real lead payloads in\npublic issues, fixtures, screenshots or logs. Repository guidance excludes .env, SQLite, generated media, provider payloads, contact exports and agent history from Git.",
